+ * the shipped kernel (01_dumps/stock/Image.stock, code at offset
+ * 0x1e330-0x1e3b8: OPTION &= ~0x2, DURATION0-3 bits [11:4] = 0x11,
+ * CONFIGURATION |= 0xf).
